  // Statewide car-to-car / calling channel for travel status (a.k.a. "CALTAC" on the radio).
  // Statewide Mutual Aid Radio System: this channel shall have no other name than CALCORD.
  // Cross-boundary tone guidance published by the AEU Cover Crew Guide for crews
  // running into the neighbouring unit. Useful in both directions on the TCU/AEU line.
  // Reference sources. Every unit gets the statewide set; a few have their own.
  // Deep links to individual unit fire-plan PDFs are deliberately NOT stored —
  // those URLs carry rev/hash query params that could not be verified, so the
  // OSFM index is linked instead and you pick your unit from there.
